profiler-mcp

The AMD uProf invocation pattern and collect-stdout contract (the
"Generated data files path:" / "Generated report file:" lines and the
`profile --config hotspots` one-shot flow) were learned from the uprof_mcp
component of AMDResearch/intellikit (https://github.com/AMDResearch/intellikit),
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.
This project re-implements that behavior independently; no intellikit code is vendored.

Verbatim profiler output samples used as test fixtures were captured from
publicly available repositories and documentation; provenance for each is
recorded in docs/research/captures-vtune.md and docs/research/captures-uprof.md.
